<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine stock market closed due to heavy rain.</title>
<headline>Philippine stock market closed due to heavy rain.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange (PSE) said on Tuesday the stock market was closed for the day due to bad weather.</p>
<p>The stock market main index closed 3.28 percent lower on Monday at 2,368.67, hit by the peso's record low and the sharp fallin U.S. shares at the end of last week.</p>
<p>Trading is expected to resume on Wednesday.</p>
